# Before: positive existential proof IR existed, but existential facts and
# ordered witness projections could not be emitted.
# Now: introduction and Classical.choose elimination replay exact FactIds.
witness exist x R st {x = 1} from 1:
    1 = 1
obtain y from exist x R st {x = 1}
y = 1
# Boundary: exist!, negated existentials, or changed projection roles fail.
